  <item>
    <title>Knoxville: data center moratorium — Enacted</title>
    <link>https://aigridwatch.com/communities/knoxville-tn</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">mora-knoxville-tn</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 15 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description>1-year moratorium on large data centers (10+ MW peak demand). Pauses permits, building approvals, utility extensions, and development agreements. Expires Jul 7, 2027 or when zoning amendments take effect, whichever is first</description>
  </item>
